 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f_VEVSHy8aoQ7kNvwHBLO3V&_nc_oc=Adof33w98Ig8jTaqySQnfda4GSz7fkBgeAczdK31Hqs5FAsAgH7YOICz3r0bV2ly_IQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOn_I4s5xinVcDILQYd34jvM3qdtPkyUX7bJn429Ka41g&oe=6AC26E41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t2OKWVvxMEUQ7kNvwGCDEhd&_nc_oc=AdqNX2ByECzE73k_9lQgEcu5Q405lexKbcNEjwCsfFF-3HBGUclzRmAklgbbX1dcjZo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP6aePWwcLiirTyYs2VAbiEAsrDVgagXc-2BmNn01C-3Q&oe=6AC27BA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i8E6JrErcq4Q7kNvwHT-SMV&_nc_oc=AdrMAs8bAHSwtU57k0NksvGAdG8dCiY5r4GMm7vmNrw5CsH3bJFj2RTWTypm1tGqzIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMQTU9Xks9tus-g32liySfiDuG9c5XQF06KSWyf_pdEvQ&oe=6AC24D5C"}, {"fil